From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:09:31 +0000
Subject: fix(compose): keep profiler file output alive across Pager lifecycle

Profiler file output was bound to the Pager that started the profiler and
lost queued writes when that Pager was destroyed. Register FileModules from
every live ComposeContainer, marshal file IO onto the Kuikly thread, retry
a lost operation on another live Pager with an idempotent operationId
(Android/iOS/OHOS hosts), and report commit results through
RecompositionProfiler.stop(completion) and getReport(saveToFile, completion).

Fork-Patch: compose-profiler-file-output-lifecycle
Origin: 5755ac04 e50633f9 d3fe2cba 60efe6cd
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

